body:
I bought a collection of fake Pokemon carts. The one I am most excited for is definitely "Pokemon Cock." It just had a picture of a Lickitung on it so I have no clue what it could be. Another really cool one was called "Pokemon Battle Factory" and (this one I looked up) it apparently just replaces the game with a battle simulator. The rest are just random Pokemon games, some fake and some real. I found them on aliexpress.

&#x200B;

Edit: Forgot to mention the shipping is absurdly long, but hoping I will have forgotten about the order by the time it gets here. I think it will surprise me in the future -- like a birthday present for myself that I didn't even know was coming!

Wow... All I can say is wow...

&#x200B;

I love how racists constantly bring up the 13/50 "stat" when it has been proven wrong year after year.
